,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-07-02T09:43:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T10:53:13Z","closed_at":"2025-07-03T10:52:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.beta1.mono.official [46c495ca2]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 7 1700 Eight-Core Processor (16 threads) - 47.93 GiB memory\n\nAndroid version 9\n\n### Issue description\n\nMigrated a project from 4.4 to 4.5beta1 and now have an issue with the godot-google-play-billing plugin for Android. I rebuilt the plugin using the new .aar library, but still it doesn't seem to connect to the service? The \"connected\"-signal is never emitted and when querying, I only get an empty dictionary in response, although it worked fine before.\n\nI also noticed that when running Remote Deploy from the Godot Editor, after having installed the same version throguh Google Play Internal Testing, the install fails with the error: \n[INSTALL_FAILED_UPDATE_INCOMPATIBLE: Package com.name.game signatures do not match previously installed version; ignoring!]\nNot sure if this was an issue in 4.4, but maybe it could be related?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nFollowing the steps on <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/platform/android/android_in_app_purchases.html> should probably do it, but of course you also need an app with some kind of in app purchase setup on Google Play Console.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI made a test-project here with an In-app purchase on the Google Play Console. You need to download and install the Gradle build template.\n\nEdit: I just tested it on 4.4.1 and there it works fine, but not on 4.5beta1 however.\n\n[TestApp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21017120/TestApp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108193/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reas